    "Submitting this inquiry does not purchase advertising or any app subscription. A FanGeo representative will contact you about real-world promotion for your venue or event. Business Pro and FanGeo+ digital subscriptions are purchased separately through Apple In-App Purchase when launched." : {
      "comment" : "A disclaimer for the business sponsor inquiry form.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Durch das Absenden dieser Anfrage wird weder Werbung noch ein App-Abonnement erworben. Ein FanGeo-Vertreter wird sich bezüglich der tatsächlichen Werbung für Ihren Veranstaltungsort oder Ihre Veranstaltung mit Ihnen in Verbindung setzen. Die digitalen Abonnements Business Pro und FanGeo+ werden beim Start separat über den Apple In-App-Kauf erworben."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Submitting this inquiry does not purchase advertising or any app subscription. A FanGeo representative will contact you about real-world promotion for your venue or event. Business Pro and FanGeo+ digital subscriptions are purchased separately through Apple In-App Purchase when launched."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Al enviar esta consulta no se compra publicidad ni ninguna suscripción a la aplicación. Un representante de FanGeo se comunicará con usted sobre la promoción real de su local o evento. Las suscripciones digitales Business Pro y FanGeo+ se compran por separado a través de Apple Compra dentro de la aplicación cuando se lanzan."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Soumettre cette demande n’achète pas de publicité ni d’abonnement à une application. Un représentant FanGeo vous contactera au sujet de la promotion réelle de votre lieu ou événement. Les abonnements numériques Business Pro et FanGeo+ sont achetés séparément via Apple In-App Purchase lors de leur lancement."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L'invio di questa richiesta non comporta l'acquisto di pubblicità o alcun abbonamento all'app. Un rappresentante FanGeo ti contatterà per la promozione nel mondo reale della tua sede o evento. Gli abbonamenti digitali Business Pro e FanGeo+ vengono acquistati separatamente tramite l'acquisto in-app Apple al momento del lancio."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Przesłanie tego zapytania nie powoduje zakupu reklam ani subskrypcji żadnej aplikacji. Przedstawiciel FanGeo skontaktuje się z Tobą w sprawie promocji Twojego miejsca lub wydarzenia w świecie rzeczywistym. Subskrypcje cyfrowe Business Pro i FanGeo+ można kupić osobno w ramach zakupu w aplikacji Apple po uruchomieniu."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O envio desta consulta não compra publicidade ou qualquer assinatura de aplicativo. Um representante FanGeo entrará em contato com você sobre a promoção real do seu local ou evento. As assinaturas digitais Business Pro e FanGeo+ são adquiridas separadamente através da compra no aplicativo Apple quando lançadas."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Отправка этого запроса не оплачивает рекламу или подписку на приложение. Представитель FanGeo свяжется с вами по поводу реального продвижения вашего заведения или мероприятия. Цифровые подписки Business Pro и FanGeo+ приобретаются отдельно посредством покупки внутри приложения Apple при запуске."
          }
        },
        "sq" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dorëzimi i këtij hetimi nuk blen reklama ose ndonjë abonim në aplikacion. Një përfaqësues FanGeo do t'ju kontaktojë në lidhje me promovimin në botën reale për vendin ose ngjarjen tuaj. Abonimet dixhitale Business Pro dhe FanGeo+ blihen veçmas përmes Apple Blerje brenda aplikacionit kur lançohen."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "提交此查询不会购买广告或任何应用程序订阅。 FanGeo 代表将就您的场地或活动的实际推广事宜与您联系。 Business Pro 和FanGeo+ 数字订阅在推出时通过Apple 应用内购买单独购买。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Submitting this inquiry does not purchase advertising. A FanGeo representative will contact you with available sponsorship opportunities and pricing." : {
      "comment" : "Footer on the business sponsorship inquiry form clarifying that submission is not a purchase and that FanGeo will follow up with options and pricing.",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
